{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y的大块基本能独立交代人物此刻的状态和因果，X只看高亮词容易得到几个情绪片段，关系脉络不够完整；load：Y的短块更适合快速扫读，虽然个别块把两层意思挤在一起，旁注也增加了信息量，但整体仍比X的长句容易抓重点。small、core、fine：X的感受补充更具体、有辨识度，也更贴着人物当下的体验，整曲更持续地呈现亲密的幸福与留不住它的痛楚如何纠缠；Y有些内容偏离，例如「情色暖意」和「整理衣服关门」，削弱了情感主线。human：X的措辞整体更符合日常表达，Y有「怕太需要」「藏喜欢」「强装完整」「气味身体幻想遗憾快感」等搭配生硬、名词堆叠或省略过度的问题；concise：判平，X有叙述偏长和意思重复的问题，Y虽然压缩了主线，却也存在感受与旁注重复表达的情况。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3a100270-5d25-4dc9-8ccc-2e6ed3fd68a6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T143710223143Z", "elapsed_seconds": 143.531, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T14:39:33.772942+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b7bc0fbcaa0e87a78e4ee10b06912dac0e255d16129511845d3325eba9ad6cf2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "t